<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 257-2 V INDIA AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 257-2 V INDIA AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 257 for two wickets in their second innings at lunch on the fourth day of the second cricket test match against India at Eden Gardens on Saturday.</p>
<p>Darryl Cullinan was not out at 101 and skipper Hansie Cronje was not out at two.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 428 and 257 for two, India 329.</p>
